OL,3,GNEWSACentury-old bridge could get #10m
OL,4,Arepair cash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA river crossing that is more than 100
OL,7,Fyears old could get #10m for repairs
OL,8,Fafter a council made a bid for
OL,9,Fgovernment funding.
OL,11,FCarrow Bridge in Norwich provides a key
OL,12,Froute into the city and is used by
OL,13,Fabout 30,000 vehicles and pedestrians a
OL,14,Fday, Norfolk County Council said.
OL,16,FThe authority has now submitted a bid
OL,17,Ffor the money to the Department for
OL,18,FTransport (DfT), which would support a
OL,19,Frepair programme.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
