OL,3,GNEWSACentury-old bridge could get #10m
OL,4,Arepair cash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTom Dickerson, Reform UK cabinet member
OL,7,Ffor highways and transport, said
OL,8,Fsecuring the investment would remove a
OL,9,F"maintenance headache".
